# Line endings are part of this repository's verification, not a cosmetic preference.
#
# The falsifier harness locates its mutation sites by matching exact source strings, and three of
# those anchors span more than one line. Under `core.autocrlf=true` — the Windows default — the
# committed blobs are LF while the checked-out working tree is CRLF, so those anchors match nothing.
# The harness then reports its mutations as uncaught, which is the same false green it exists to
# detect, arriving through the checkout instead of through the code.
#
# `eol=lf` pins the working tree to LF on every platform, so a clone verifies the bytes that were
# tagged rather than a locally re-encoded copy of them. Found immediately before the v1.0.0 tag, by
# checking that the verification reproduces from a fresh clone rather than assuming it would.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.pdf binary
*.ico binary
